@startuml
title Life Planning - End-to-End Flow (iPad / Java)
skinparam backgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 14
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
actor Agent
participant "React Native\niPad 11-inch" as Mobile
participant "API Gateway" as Gateway
participant "Java Life Planning API" as API
participant "Product / Rider Config" as Config
participant "Calculation Engine" as Calc
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
participant "Document Service" as Doc
participant "Quotation Service" as Quote

Agent -> Mobile: Open Life Planning
Mobile -> Gateway: GET /v1/life-plannings/{id}
Gateway -> API: Validate JWT, agent permission
API -> DB: Load plan + latest version + child tables
DB --> API: Aggregate data
API --> Mobile: Plan detail and permissions

Agent -> Mobile: Edit Step 0-6 data
Mobile -> API: PUT /v1/life-plannings/{id}/steps/{step}
API -> Config: Validate product/rider/config baseline
Config --> API: Configuration and limits
API -> DB: Begin transaction
API -> DB: Lock latest version
API -> DB: Save step data and audit event
API -> DB: Commit
API --> Mobile: Saved version + ETag

Agent -> Mobile: Calculate plan
Mobile -> API: POST /v1/life-plannings/{id}/calculations
API -> DB: Load immutable calculation snapshot
API -> Config: Get rate, fee, rider rules
API -> Calc: Calculate monthly projection
Calc --> API: AV, benefits, premium, validation
API -> DB: Save calculation result + projections
API --> Mobile: Calculation summary and warnings

alt Validation passed
  Agent -> Mobile: Generate proposal
  Mobile -> API: POST /v1/life-plannings/{id}/documents
  API -> Doc: Generate PDF from calculation version
  Doc --> API: documentId, checksum, storageKey
  API -> DB: Save document metadata
  API --> Mobile: Secure document URL

  Agent -> Mobile: Submit to Quotation
  Mobile -> API: POST /v1/life-plannings/{id}/submit
  API -> Quote: Create quotation from locked snapshot
  Quote --> API: quotationId / error
  API -> DB: Update submission status and reference
  API --> Mobile: Submitted
else Validation failed
  API --> Mobile: Field-level errors
  Mobile --> Agent: Highlight fields and return to task
end
@enduml
